    "slug": "cite-apa7",
    "doc": "---\nname: cite-apa7\ndescription: \"APA 7th edition citation and reference-list conventions (in-text and references). Use when formatting or checking APA-style citations in academic writing.\"\nlicense: Proprietary\nmetadata:\n  author: aqsha\n  version: \"1.0\"\n  scope: builtin\n  triggerKeywords: [sitasi, daftar, pustaka, referensi, apa, in-text, gaya, konvensi, edisi, format]\n---\nOutput follows APA 7th edition; reference text may be Indonesian.\n\n## In-text\nAuthor–year format: `(Vaswani et al., 2017)`. Add a page number for direct quotes: `(Smith, 2020, p. 12)`. Use \"et al.\" from the first citation when there are three or more authors.\n\n## Reference list\nOrder alphabetically by the first author's surname. Journal-article pattern: `Author, A. A., & Author, B. B. (Year). Article title. *Journal Name, Volume*(Issue), pages. https://doi.org/xxxx`\n\n## Notes\nInclude the DOI as a full URL when available. Never fabricate an entry — mark it `[perlu sumber]` when a reference is not yet verified.\n",
